# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages header rules (see HOSTING.md). Other hosts: set the same headers.
# The file names don't change between versions: revalidate them (no `immutable`), or an upgrade
# could leave browsers with an old module, or old glue next to a new module.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
